      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "When LeBlanc drops below 40% Health, she becomes invisible for 1 second and creates a Mirror Image that deals no damage and lasts for up to 8 seconds.",
      "summary_zh": "当乐芙兰跌至40%最大生命值以下时，她会隐形1秒并创造一个幻像（不能造成伤害），幻像最多可持续8秒。",
