      ],
      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "LeBlanc projects a sigil, dealing damage and marking the target for 3.5 seconds. Damaging the marked target with an ability detonates the sigil, dealing additional damage. If either part kills the target, Leblanc refunds the Mana cost and part of this spell's remaining Cooldown.",
      "summary_zh": "乐芙兰朝目标投射一个魔印，造成魔法伤害并标记目标3.5秒。用一个技能对被标记的目标造成伤害时，会引爆魔印，造成附加伤害。如果这两部分伤害中有任一部分击杀了目标，那么乐芙兰就会返还此技能的法力消耗和此技能的一部分剩余冷却时间。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308147:3985524"
      ]
    },
    {
