      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "LeBlanc dashes to a location, dealing damage to enemies near her destination. For the next 4 seconds, activate Distortion again to return LeBlanc to her starting location.",
      "summary_zh": "乐芙兰位移至目标位置，并对目标位置附近的敌人造成伤害。在接下来的4秒里，她可以激活此技能来回到她的初始位置。",
